# This is a JetBrains scratches directory, so it holds a lot besides practice code:
# Python virtualenvs, .pyc/.so binaries, unrelated projects, and api_keys.text.
# Track ONLY the practice material under AAScratches - Java sources and study notes.

# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but descend into directories so the allow-list below can match.
!*/

# ...then allow back exactly what belongs in this repo.
!AAScratches/**/*.java
!AAScratches/**/*.md
!/.gitignore

# Unrelated work that happens to live in this folder - never publish these.
/Learn-HLD/
/Personal/

# Secrets. Belt and braces: already covered by `*`, restated so intent is explicit
# and so no future edit to the allow-list can accidentally expose them.
api_keys.text
**/api_keys*
**/*.env
**/*credentials*

# Local-only reports regenerated by `verify-scratches`.
/VERIFY-REPORT.json
/VERIFY-REPORT.md
/.doc-scratches-state.json
